1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Hat dich der 7. Oktober verändert?

2
00:00:07,366 --> 00:00:08,433
Oh yes it did.

3
00:00:11,266 --> 00:00:12,900
Before October 7th,

4
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,900
I thought that I was very brave and that,

5
00:00:15,933 --> 00:00:17,166
unlike my family,

6
00:00:17,166 --> 00:00:20,133
I'm not going to move around because of terror.

7
00:00:23,166 --> 00:00:24,833
But

8
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:30,166
when the level of terror reached

9
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,866
the level of terror that they went through in Libya,

10
00:00:35,766 --> 00:00:38,600
or in any other place in the Middle East...

11
00:00:40,433 --> 00:00:43,800
I remember so well the stories from Libya,

12
00:00:44,433 --> 00:00:47,800
there's one story that I remember that my mom told me,

13
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:52,600
that her uncle used to keep a can of gasoline,

14
00:00:52,933 --> 00:00:56,800
a big can of gasoline in his house because

15
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:01,066
he said that if the mob ever gets to his house,

16
00:01:01,066 --> 00:01:04,166
it will be a much better fate

17
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:07,433
for the family to be burnt alive,

18
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,700
rather than be caught by the mob.

19
00:01:11,233 --> 00:01:14,500
So, I heard all the stories,

20
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:15,633
about

21
00:01:16,433 --> 00:01:19,333
women that they cut the breasts off

22
00:01:19,333 --> 00:01:20,533
or pregnant

23
00:01:20,533 --> 00:01:22,600
women with bellies cut open.

24
00:01:22,633 --> 00:01:24,433
We heard all those stories,

25
00:01:24,733 --> 00:01:27,600
I must say that we've never dwelled in them.

26
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:28,366
I've never went like

27
00:01:28,366 --> 00:01:31,000
"Free, free my grandparents house in Libya"

28
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,066
Never happened,

29
00:01:32,766 --> 00:01:34,733
even though it’s a very catchy tune.

30
00:01:35,366 --> 00:01:39,700
But all they wanted was to run away to Israel,

31
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:42,933
and have their haven. have their...

32
00:01:43,166 --> 00:01:44,366
Their place, you know.

33
00:01:44,366 --> 00:01:46,600
Having been originated in this region,

34
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:50,600
I think that there must be a haven

35
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:52,300
in the Middle East for me.

36
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:54,366
And there isn't. There isn't.

37
00:01:54,366 --> 00:01:56,266
Not for me, not for my children.

38
00:01:56,533 --> 00:01:59,133
Because even when being limited to the tiny,

39
00:01:59,133 --> 00:02:04,433
tiny Israel, I can’t have a quiet life over here,

40
00:02:05,633 --> 00:02:07,200
in this area.

41
00:02:19,533 --> 00:02:20,666
So...

42
00:02:21,966 --> 00:02:23,933
After October 7th,

43
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:27,600
I don’t know,

44
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:31,900
if I will be able to be that link in the chain,

45
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:34,533
that did not submit to terror.

46
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,233
Time will tell. Right now,

47
00:02:37,233 --> 00:02:39,566
I took another year outside of the kibbutz,

48
00:02:39,566 --> 00:02:42,233
we still haven’t come back.

49
00:02:45,566 --> 00:02:50,600
My son is also a very important

50
00:02:51,933 --> 00:02:52,733
element here,

51
00:02:52,733 --> 00:02:56,800
because he cannot run for shelter in a few seconds.

52
00:02:58,833 --> 00:03:00,866
We need to see,

53
00:03:02,633 --> 00:03:05,633
this threat needs to be lifted off our shoulders.

54
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:08,933
People around the world don’t really understand it.

55
00:03:08,933 --> 00:03:10,600
They don’t understand

56
00:03:11,133 --> 00:03:13,733
How important it is

57
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:23,466
to dismantle Hamas.

58
00:03:24,166 --> 00:03:27,533
Because firstly,

59
00:03:27,533 --> 00:03:30,500
from all the Palestinians that I had known

60
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:31,666
throughout the years,

61
00:03:31,666 --> 00:03:34,833
the stories I hear about Hamas when their

62
00:03:34,833 --> 00:03:37,400
people are over here and they're not,

63
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:39,866
there are horrible stories.

64
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,200
And if you want to call yourself a

65
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:45,833
left cleaning person or humanitarian person,

66
00:03:45,833 --> 00:03:47,766
you wouldn’t want anyone in the world,

67
00:03:47,766 --> 00:03:50,733
anyone, to be ruled by someone like that.

68
00:03:50,933 --> 00:03:53,633
They are torturing both sides of the borders.

69
00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:55,133
Don’t be mistaken.

70
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,100
The second thing is that

71
00:03:58,166 --> 00:04:00,766
there are so many things that people don’t know.

72
00:04:00,766 --> 00:04:03,100
Living with

73
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:06,100
that threat over your head 24/7,

74
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:10,466
there are things in life that

75
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:12,533
you can’t even think about,

76
00:04:12,766 --> 00:04:15,933
but they're in the back of my mind all the time:

77
00:04:15,933 --> 00:04:19,200
I will never wear high heels.

78
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:22,800
Never. My shoes will be always good enough for running.

79
00:04:23,233 --> 00:04:27,733
If my child is sick and he's in his bedroom,

80
00:04:27,733 --> 00:04:30,733
which is the bomb shelter of the house,

81
00:04:31,133 --> 00:04:35,300
and I need to get some fresh air inside,

82
00:04:35,333 --> 00:04:37,566
I will have to think twice:

83
00:04:37,566 --> 00:04:39,200
"Wait, is it safe enough today?"

84
00:04:39,233 --> 00:04:42,000
to open the iron shutters of the bomb shelters,

85
00:04:42,133 --> 00:04:43,500
or is it not?

86
00:04:45,166 --> 00:04:48,500
I can be with my children in the playground,

87
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:51,766
and have drizzles of rockets coming in

88
00:04:51,766 --> 00:04:53,800
within seconds, like that.

89
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:57,000
"4 seconds, get shelter, take shelter".

90
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:04,400
This threat needs to be lifted off our shoulders.

91
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:08,700
And anyone who sits thousands

92
00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:11,033
of miles away

93
00:05:11,033 --> 00:05:14,200
and thinks that this is something that is acceptable,

94
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:17,833
please again bring your family over here.

95
00:05:17,966 --> 00:05:21,700
Bring your children, bring your great grandchildren,

96
00:05:23,033 --> 00:05:25,566
raise them where I raise mine.

97
00:05:25,566 --> 00:05:30,100
I promise you, on my porch with a wine,

98
00:05:30,100 --> 00:05:31,466
A lovely chit chat

99
00:05:31,533 --> 00:05:34,766
on the fine arts of resilience and retaliation.

100
00:05:34,766 --> 00:05:37,366
But until you do that, you don’t really get to say

101
00:05:37,366 --> 00:05:39,600
about how I protect my children,

102
00:05:39,733 --> 00:05:41,733
because most of the people...

103
00:05:42,333 --> 00:05:45,200
Let me articulate it like this...

104
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:46,900
Let me put it like this:

105
00:05:47,033 --> 00:05:49,033
The gap between what people think

106
00:05:49,033 --> 00:05:50,333
they know about this region,

107
00:05:50,333 --> 00:05:52,400
and reality, is scary.

108
00:05:53,233 --> 00:05:54,400
And imagine,

109
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:00,200
and look what the Middle East looked like

110
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:04,100
and look what the Middle East looked like

111
00:06:04,100 --> 00:06:07,500
hundreds of years ago. Just look what it looked like,

112
00:06:07,966 --> 00:06:10,300
and what it has become today.

113
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,766
For us as Middle Easterns,

114
00:06:14,766 --> 00:06:16,133
and I also speak,

115
00:06:16,133 --> 00:06:18,866
with Kurds and with Druze and with

116
00:06:20,633 --> 00:06:21,800
different friends that I have,

117
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:24,933
from different ethnicities around the Middle East,

118
00:06:25,300 --> 00:06:26,633
they don’t understand.

119
00:06:30,566 --> 00:06:34,733
The ignorance of people about our region is frightening,

120
00:06:34,733 --> 00:06:35,900
it’s really frightening.

121
00:06:37,566 --> 00:06:42,000
And if October 7 changed me? It absolutely did.

122
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,000
Absolutely did.

